            "type": "text",
            "text": "Head"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "19-round sphere, 7 cm diameter in skin-tone dk yarn. Fit 9 mm safety eyes between rounds 7 and 8. Stuff firmly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cylinder, 7 cm diameter and 10 cm tall in purple or black dk yarn. Work both ends closed. Stuff firmly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Arms (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Capsule, 2.5 cm wide and 6 cm long in skin-tone, with the lower 2 cm in purple or black for the sleeve. Stuff lightly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hat cone"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tall cone, 7 cm base and 10 cm tall in black dk yarn. Do not stuff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hat brim"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Flat circle, 10 cm diameter in black. Work as a flat granny circle: magic ring, 6 dc, increase to 12, 18, 24 until the circle is wide enough. Do not stuff. Sew the hat cone to the brim using whip stitch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the head to the top of the body. Attach the arms to either side of the upper body. Place the finished hat on top of the head and sew the brim edge to the sides of the head to hold it in place."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hair"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cut lengths of black or grey yarn, each about 10 cm. Attach them using lark's head knots around the lower edge of the hat brim to frame the face. Trim to a ragged length."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "invisible-decrease-a79"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "invisible decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " throughout. Embroider a small wart or crooked nose in dark thread if desired. Weave in all ends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Materials needed"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Approximately 34 g in purple and black dk yarn, small amount of skin-tone yarn for the head and arms. 9 mm safety eyes. Polyester stuffing. Tapestry needle."
          }
        ]
      }
